Z||000016||Wes Tausend||01-15-2001||10:43 PM||||Hello all,<P>This reply is my first post to this great forum. I too have looked at the excellent job Jason is doing on his Lambo and talked details with him. The front wing is a custom built addition by Jason. He went to great lengths to get it right and it looks very, very good. Jason is a very dedicated and talented craftsman. His work is impeccable thru-out the car. It doesn't matter to him if the work will be eventually covered or not...it all looks great.<P>Wes||||reg||1
